<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKLoggingOntology#code400> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://persistence.uni-leipzig.org/nlp2rdf/ontologies/rlog#StatusCode> .
