<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKLoggingOntology#code400> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The server cannot or will not process the request due to something that is perceived to be a client error (e.g., malformed request syntax, invalid request message framing, or deceptive request routing)."@en .
