<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKLoggingOntology#code401> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Although the HTTP standard specifies \"unauthorized\", semantically this response means \"unauthenticated\". That is, the client must authenticate itself to get the requested response."@en .
